WEBVTT

00:02:29.177 --> 00:02:30.133
So let's do this.

00:02:30.157 --> 00:02:33.102
Let's take baseball
and pizza and compare it

00:02:33.126 --> 00:02:36.546
when talking about three aspects
of sexual activity:

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.199
the trigger for sexual activity,

00:02:38.223 --> 00:02:40.417
what happens during sexual activity,

00:02:40.441 --> 00:02:43.569
and the expected outcome
of sexual activity.

00:02:43.593 --> 00:02:46.377
So when do you play baseball?

00:02:46.401 --> 00:02:48.817
You play baseball when
it's baseball season

00:02:48.841 --> 00:02:51.099
and when there's a game on the schedule.

00:02:51.123 --> 00:02:53.409
It's not exactly your choice.

00:02:53.433 --> 00:02:56.305
So if it's prom night or a wedding night

00:02:56.329 --> 00:02:59.375
or at a party or if our parents
aren't home,

00:02:59.399 --> 00:03:02.107
hey, it's just batter up.